<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Historical_method" title="Historical method">Historical</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Interview_(research)" title="Interview (research)">Interview</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mathematical_sociology" title="Mathematical sociology">Mathematical</a></li>
