</tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content">
<div class="sidebar-list mw-collapsible mw-collapsed"><div class="sidebar-list-title" style="color: var(--color-base)"><div class="sidebar-list-title-c"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_sociologists" title="List of sociologists">Major theorists</a></div></div><div class="sidebar-list-content mw-collapsible-content">
<ul><li><b>1700s:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louis_de_Bonald" title="Louis de Bonald">Bonald</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Auguste_Comte" title="Auguste Comte">Comte</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emmanuel_Joseph_Sieyès" title="Emmanuel Joseph Sieyès">Sieyès</a><br/></li></ul>
<p><b>1800s:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harriet_Martineau" title="Harriet Martineau">Martineau</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alexis_de_Tocqueville" title="Alexis de Tocqueville">Tocqueville</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karl_Marx" title="Karl Marx">Marx</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herbert_Spencer" title="Herbert Spencer">Spencer</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gustave_Le_Bon" title="Gustave Le Bon">Le Bon</a>  · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lester_Frank_Ward" title="Lester Frank Ward">Ward</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vilfredo_Pareto" title="Vilfredo Pareto">Pareto</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ferdinand_Tönnies" title="Ferdinand Tönnies">Tönnies</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thorstein_Veblen" title="Thorstein Veblen">Veblen</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Georg_Simmel" title="Georg Simmel">Simmel</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Émile_Durkheim" title="Émile Durkheim">Durkheim</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jane_Addams" title="Jane Addams">Addams</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/George_Herbert_Mead" title="George Herbert Mead">Mead</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Max_Weber" title="Max Weber">Weber</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/W._E._B._Du_Bois" title="W. E. B. Du Bois">Du Bois</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karl_Mannheim" title="Karl Mannheim">Mannheim</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norbert_Elias" title="Norbert Elias">Elias</a><br/></p>
<b>1900s:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erich_Fromm" title="Erich Fromm">Fromm</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talcott_Parsons" title="Talcott Parsons">Parsons</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theodor_W._Adorno" title="Theodor W. Adorno">Adorno</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arnold_Gehlen" title="Arnold Gehlen">Gehlen</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raymond_Aron" title="Raymond Aron">Aron</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_K._Merton" title="Robert K. Merton">Merton</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Nisbet" title="Robert Nisbet">Nisbet</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/C._Wright_Mills" title="C. Wright Mills">Mills</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daniel_Bell" title="Daniel Bell">Bell</a>  · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helmut_Schoeck" title="Helmut Schoeck">Schoeck</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erving_Goffman" title="Erving Goffman">Goffman</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zygmunt_Bauman" title="Zygmunt Bauman">Bauman</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michel_Foucault" title="Michel Foucault">Foucault</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Niklas_Luhmann" title="Niklas Luhmann">Luhmann </a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jürgen_Habermas" title="Jürgen Habermas">Habermas</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jean_Baudrillard" title="Jean Baudrillard">Baudrillard</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pierre_Bourdieu" title="Pierre Bourdieu">Bourdieu</a> · <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anthony_Giddens" title="Anthony Giddens">Giddens</a></div></div></td>
</tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content">
<div class="sidebar-list mw-collapsible mw-collapsed"><div class="sidebar-list-title" style="color: var(--color-base)"><div class="sidebar-list-title-c"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Index_of_sociology_articles" title="Index of sociology articles">Lists</a></div></div><div class="sidebar-list-content mw-collapsible-content"><link typeof="mw:Extension/section" about="#mwt16" data-mw='{"name":"section","attrs":{"begin":"Lists"}}'/>
